ket triage:updates subscription for real-time updates, and static mode read-only support. All 8 own ACs and relevant trait ACs (ac-1-3) covered with 18 tests.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": \"01KJ3FXJJ\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement Triage Agent Export\",\n      \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-23T01:37:07.220Z\",\n      \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #454. Shared triage export formatter in src/export/triage.ts extracted from CLI and daemon. Two formats: context (markdown) and JSON. All 4 own ACs and 6 trait ACs (@trait-json-output) covered with 18 dedicated tests. Prior review findings (2 MUST-FIX, 1 SHOULD-FIX) addressed in fix cycle.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": \"01KJ3FXJ0\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement Triage Daemon API\",\n      \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-23T01:05:05.388Z\",\n      \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #453. Implemented 6 triage API endpoints (GET list, GET export, POST create, GET single, POST override, POST act) with full own AC coverage (9/9), trait AC coverage (api-endpoint 5/6, websocket-protocol 1/1 route-level), 26 tests passing. Fix commit addressed upsert identity and stale metadata issues from initial review.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": \"01KJ3SMT\",\n      \"title\": \"Fix daemon-executable bun build --compile failure\",\n      \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-23T00:31:47.028Z\",\n      \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #452. Fixed bun build --compile failure by changing the compile source from packages/daemon/src/index.ts to dist/daemon/index.ts where cross-package relative imports resolve correctly. All 3 daemon-executable tests pass. AC @daemon-server ac-16 covered.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": \"01KHY9W8\",\n      \"title\": \"Bump @agentclientprotocol/sdk to ^0.14.0\",\n      \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-23T00:24:30.815Z\",\n      \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #451. Bumped @agentclientprotocol/sdk from ^0.13.0 to ^0.14.0. Types-only devDependency with zero breaking changes. All CI checks passed, 3105 tests green.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ref\": \"01KJ3FXH3\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement Interactive Triage System\",\n      \"completed_at\": \"2026-02-23T00:07:58.393Z\",\n      \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #450. Parent spec @interactive-triage ac-1 and ac-2 proven with integration tests: end-to-end decision chain test (agent record → override → act → export with attribution/timestamp verification in export output) and persistence test (records survive inbox deletion). Codex review caught incomplete ac-2 coverage in export assertions — fixed in follow-up commit. All CI green.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recent_commits\": [\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"d5e0d4a\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"d5e0d4a68f6d402c1e851f08b7989549df3053cf\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T08:15:06.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"feat: split CI tests into 3 parallel shards (#462)\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"294463e\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"294463e0dbe9be93566f57b6abe27d337bb55aae\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T08:08:19.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"fix: bump timeout on session-start-notes completed tasks test\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"32509f4\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"32509f4664104010d0e4986b9347d7791f13afe0\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T08:01:02.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"feat: split CI tests into 3 parallel shards\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"7c81198\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"7c81198bb85fd67e4d65c8e3edc690e4df814576\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T08:00:26.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"feat: add path-based filtering to CI test workflow (#461)\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"0bd0fa0\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"0bd0fa0b7677952fdbd89302c79342ee88eb762f\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T07:45:56.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"fix: add templates/ to CI path filter (loaded at runtime by src/)\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"7b7d729\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"7b7d729532d5af9243944c2144dda505f48c1c95\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T07:44:18.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"fix: remove plugin/ from CI path filter (gitignored build artifact)\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"a5031a8\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"a5031a81bbe71f7298ac264e4677114e07037172\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T07:43:27.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"feat: add path-based filtering to CI test workflow\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"66492a8\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"66492a836e60945f924142c298d7c5a174a92f5f\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T07:40:41.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"fix: clarify inbox vs task guidance in reflect skill (#460)\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"59c942d\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"59c942d174a48fcdbe292d5e0f44ac3aad8215ed\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T07:38:44.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"fix: align table wording and add loop mode task creation hedge\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"6c35d3d\",\n      \"full_hash\": \"6c35d3df9174acd6589ed82f8b1d681a46f652ff\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-02-23T07:34:56.000Z\",\n      \"message\": \"fix: simplify inbox vs task guidance - not everything needs a spec\",\n      \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"working_tree\": {\n    \"clean\": true,\n    \"staged\": [],\n    \"unstaged\": [],\n    \"untracked\": []\n  },\n  \"inbox_items\": [\n    {\n      \"ref\": \"01KFH76C\",\n      \"text\": \"Cross-feature requirement pattern: How to express that core features (search, validate, export) must support all entity types. When new entity type added, should automatically imply tasks for core features. Options: (1) applies_to field on feature specs, (2) trait on entity types like @trait-searchable, (3) validation warning for missing coverage, (4) parent spec that entity types must satisfy. Surfaced when realizing search doesn't cover inbox.\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-01-21T21:25:59.163Z\",\n      \"tags